      ],
      "en": "Elimelech, Naomi’s husband, died; and she was left with her two sons.",
      "ko": "나오미의 남편 엘리멜렉이 죽고 나오미와 그 두 아들이 남았으며",
      "source_text_hash": "31bf507012f62a6eb56c1202caae832c34de26d362994ed71e1267d253885e53",
      "translation_text_hash": "e2f49f43d02fe8f05b42152a1f0b88a3b92c98ecd63aec6ccdd95b97830e6f5b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "나오미의 남편 엘리멜렉이 죽고 나오미와 그 두 아들이 남았으며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "e2f49f43d02fe8f05b42152a1f0b88a3b92c98ecd63aec6ccdd95b97830e6f5b"
      ]
