        "verse": 7
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "RUT",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "She went out of the place where she was, and her two daughters-in-law with her. They went on the way to return to the land of Judah.",
      "ko": "있던 곳을 떠나고 두 자부도 그와 함께하여 유다 땅으로 돌아오려고 길을 행하다가",
      "source_text_hash": "86e679a909cb29ad820277b6dbdce961ad54d6425ac4b6a65fb825624ef3e7be",
      "translation_text_hash": "7efaae12ef36c5ee22124524c483c6c3e670b27f7f78f09f8ba35c1c9c2fff4b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "있던 곳을 떠나고 두 자부도 그와 함께하여 유다 땅으로 돌아오려고 길을 행하다가"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7efaae12ef36c5ee22124524c483c6c3e670b27f7f78f09f8ba35c1c9c2fff4b"
